* `String.prototype.localeCompare(searchStr, locale [, options])`: This method compares two strings, returning a negative, zero, or positive value depending on the result. We're using this method to perform case-insensitive and locale-aware string comparisons.
* `Object.fromEntries(iterable)`: This function creates a new JSON object from an iterable (like an array of key-value pairs) that can be converted to an object.

